                        "entry_id": "8ca13a46-0f17-3a5e-a724-84d4fe9c25bd",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A southeast Asian and Australian tree (Toona ciliata or Toona australis) of the mahogany family with fragrant dark red wood and flowers that yield a dye."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
