                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dbb222a3-66cd-3844-9ba0-29336d7703e8",
                        "entry_id": "51071967-8a20-3600-8045-6cb5c1e0b10c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "紅椿，分佈在東南亞和澳大利亞的楝科樹種（Toona ciliata 或 Toona australis），木材色暗紅、香氣濃厚，花朵可作染料。"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e2fc473f-c3dd-481b-8de6-46c9099ddd7c",
                                "sense_id": "dbb222a3-66cd-3844-9ba0-29336d7703e8",
                                "text": "Each plot held 10 cull trees so that 60 Australian toon and 40 tropical ash trees were treated."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a03db522-5ebc-34db-acf1-c432f492bede",
                        "entry_id": "51071967-8a20-3600-8045-6cb5c1e0b10c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "這種樹的木材。"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "05c73d43-e495-4126-af12-a63446c68b38",
                                "sense_id": "a03db522-5ebc-34db-acf1-c432f492bede",
                                "text": "After 7 years, all paint combinations except the self-primed latex are showing some failure on all species of wood except Australian toon."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
